    skos:definition "Olivine-websterite - A type of olivine-pyroxenite. In the Rock Classification Scheme, it is an olivine-pyroxenite with olivine 5 - 40%, orthopyroxene 5 - 90% and clinopyroxene 5 - 90% of olivine + orthopyroxene + clinopyroxene. British Geological Survey Research Report RR/99/06, section 5.1 and figs. 15, 16."@en ;
    skos:inScheme <http://data.bgs.ac.uk/ref/EarthMaterialClass/RockName> ;
    skos:notation "OLWEBS"@en ;
    skos:prefLabel "Olivine-websterite"@en ;
.

