    skos:broader rockname:GB ;
    skos:definition "Olivine-gabbro - A type of gabbro. In the Rock Classification Scheme, it is a gabbro with plagioclase 10 - 90%, pyroxene 5 - 85% and olivine 5 - 85% of plagioclase + pyroxene + olivine. British Geological Survey Research Report RR/99/06, section 5.1 and figs. 13, 14."@en ;
    skos:inScheme <http://data.bgs.ac.uk/ref/EarthMaterialClass/RockName> ;
    skos:narrower
