    skos:definition "Igneous rock and sediment - In the Rock Classification Scheme, this high level class includes fragmental igneous rock and sediment, and crystalline igneous rock. British Geological Survey Research Report RR/99/06, fig. 1."@en ;
    skos:inScheme <http://data.bgs.ac.uk/ref/EarthMaterialClass/RockName> ;
